   b. **AND**: The provider holds a **Tier 3 customs clearance**.  
   c. **AND**: The provider achieves **worker safety compliance of 90 % or higher**.

We examine the candidate items to satisfy each alternative.

### Alternative 1: 3+ regional distribution facilities
